======================================================================================================================
  [PASS] V1 [the new term is invisible to every cosmological derivation] both W and its first derivative at zero gradient are exactly what they were before the term was added, so the background quantities the whole chain from L192 to L206 was built on are unchanged: rho, j, the clock identity and the acoustic-scale bound all stand
