           (Y_min/Y_t = (4 d l/U - 1)^2 exactly; call that combination 1 + h, so the ratio is h^2)
    on the derived family the critical gradient sits at Y*/l = 0.02, and the framework's own parameter-free number is cH0/a0 = 7.0
