           (the window is 1 < 4 d l/U < 8.0, its lower end from 4 d l > U (L205's health condition) and its upper from h < cH0/a0 = 7.0 (L180's identity))
  [PASS] V6 [and the window is not empty] a window spanning a factor of eight in a single dimensionless combination is open rather than fine-tuned; what closes the question is whether the value that reproduces the observed a0 falls inside it, which requires the matter coupling this action does not yet specify
